{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Demo of the horror &quot;The LIK&quot; you will have to understand how you ended up in the Temple, what is happening there and where your daughter disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And the Temple will not let you just collect notes and walk around...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the atmospheric location and cinematography.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHO IS THIS GAME FOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is for those who love psychological thrillers and dark atmospheric stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the temple and collect notes, revealing through them the stories of the characters in order to make a decision on which not only your life will depend.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545780?t=1743266265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545780/764aad1e6df142022c57a0b38379186314879e76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743266265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545780/c49d4788100481433fdcd9fbdf5e3f716b4f6680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743266265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545780/c49d4788100481433fdcd9fbdf5e3f716b4f6680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743266265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Demo of the horror &quot;The LIK&quot; you will have to understand how you ended up in the Temple, what is happening there and where your daughter disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And the Temple will not let you just collect notes and walk around...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the atmospheric location and cinematography.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">